Live-Wright hand-back

* Changed `packages/lararium-web/tests/e2e/shore-writes.e2e.test.ts` to wait for new phase entries with a 20-second silence window and a 60-second ceiling. The mirror keeps its independent 20-second wait; failures retain phases and faults and identify the failed wait.
